WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.967
Personal corrections teach the app your names and jargon.

00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:07.767
Add a preferred spelling once,

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:13.833
and every later dictation uses it. These three rules are samples.

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:17.467
Download it for Mac at justspeaktoit.com.
